The SPDX standard texts THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES substitutes for a package that ships
no licence file (scripts/release/gen_notices.py, B-22): text/<id>.txt from
https://github.com/spdx/license-list-data at tag v3.29.0, only the ids needed,
each line's trailing whitespace stripped (one line each in BSD-3-Clause, ISC
and MPL-2.0).
